---
// Transport Component
---

<section class="transport-section" id="transport">
  <h2 class="transport-main-title">Getting There</h2>

  <div class="transport-notice">
    <strong>Important:</strong> Guests must not drive to the venue. All guests should park at
    the Sett Valley Car Park in Hayfield Village and travel to Upper House via our free minibus service.
  </div>

  <div class="transport-category">
    <h3 class="transport-category-title">Car Park</h3>

    <div class="transport-item">
      <h4 class="transport-label">Collection Point</h4>
      <p class="transport-detail">
        Hayfield Sett Valley Trail Car Park (by the bus station and Countryside Centre)<br />
        Station Road, Hayfield, High Peak, <strong>SK22 2ES</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="transport-detail">
        The car park is pay and display and accepts both <strong>coins and contactless</strong>.
        Overnight parking is available so you don't need to worry about collecting your car the same evening.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="transport-category">
    <h3 class="transport-category-title">Minibus Schedule — Arrival</h3>
    <p class="transport-intro">
      We have 3 × 16-seat minibuses running between the car park and the venue.
    </p>

    <div class="shuttle-grid">
      <div class="shuttle-row shuttle-header">
        <span>Departs Car Park</span>
        <span>Arrives Venue</span>
        <span>For</span>
      </div>
      <div class="shuttle-row">
        <span>TBC — 1:00 pm</span>
        <span>TBC — 1:15 pm</span>
        <span>Day guests (first shuttle)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="shuttle-row">
        <span>TBC — 1:30 pm</span>
        <span>TBC — 1:45 pm</span>
        <span>Day guests (second shuttle)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="shuttle-row shuttle-tbc">
        <span>TBC</span>
        <span>TBC</span>
        <span>Evening guests</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="transport-note">
      We'll be in touch closer to the day to let you know which shuttle you're on — we'll split
      guests between the two runs so no-one is waiting around unnecessarily.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="transport-category">
    <h3 class="transport-category-title">Minibus Schedule — Return</h3>

    <div class="shuttle-grid">
      <div class="shuttle-row shuttle-header">
        <span>Departs Venue</span>
        <span>Arrives Car Park</span>
      </div>
      <div class="shuttle-row">
        <span>TBC — from 9:30 pm</span>
        <span>TBC — ~9:45 pm</span>
      </div>
      <div class="shuttle-row shuttle-last">
        <span>TBC — last run 12:30 am</span>
        <span>TBC — ~12:45 am</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="transport-note">
      Transport will also be available throughout the day for any emergencies.
      If you need to leave before the evening shuttles begin, a minibus can take
      you back to the village — just speak to a member of the team at the venue.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="transport-category">
    <h3 class="transport-category-title">Accommodation & Taxis</h3>
    <p class="transport-detail">
      A full list of local accommodation options and taxi companies is available
      in the <a href="#accommodations">Accommodations</a> section. Remember that
      taxis in rural areas must always be booked in advance.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .transport-section {
    max-width: 87.5rem;
    width: 88%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .transport-main-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
    color: #111;
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .transport-notice {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
    border: 2px solid #111;
    background-color: transparent;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #111;
  }

  .transport-category {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #111;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .transport-category-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    color: #111;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .transport-intro {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .transport-label {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    color: #111;
    font-variant: small-caps;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .transport-detail {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .transport-item {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .shuttle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
  }

  .shuttle-row {
    display: contents;
  }

  .shuttle-row > span {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    color: #333;
  }

  .shuttle-row.shuttle-header > span {
    background-color: #111;
    color: #fffff8;
    font-variant: small-caps;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .shuttle-row.shuttle-tbc > span {
    color: #888;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .shuttle-row.shuttle-last > span {
    border-bottom: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .shuttle-row:last-child > span {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .transport-note {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .transport-section {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 4rem 1rem 3rem;
    }

    .transport-main-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .transport-category {
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .transport-category-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .shuttle-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .shuttle-row > span:nth-child(3) {
      display: none;
    }

    .shuttle-row.shuttle-header > span:nth-child(3) {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
